    "body": "## Problem\n\nOn the web app, scrolling through a profile's video grid eventually stops loading new videos — the feed stalls before reaching the end of the creator's catalog.\n\nReported by a user trying to scroll through a large set of a single creator's videos.\n\n## Expected\n\nInfinite scroll should continue paginating until there are no more videos for that profile.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Needs repro: which profile, how many videos deep before it stalls, console/network errors at the stall point.\n- Suspect areas: the profile videos pagination hook, end-of-feed sentinel logic, or a Funnelcake cursor/limit issue. Check whether the circuit breaker is opening mid-scroll and the WebSocket fallback is terminating early.",
